CM TM-WHP-NEC-006
CM 5.6m telescopic whip retracted, 17m band (18.068-18.168 MHz)
CM ---------------------------------------------------------------
CM Antenna: 7-section telescopic whip, retracted to 4.01m
CM   QW at 18.118 MHz = c/(4*f) * vf = 4.14m * 0.97 ~ 4.01m
CM   No loading coil; whip trimmed to QW resonance
CM
CM Wire geometry:
CM   GW 1: main whip, 28 segs, z=0.005 to z=4.015, radius=0.006m
CM   GW 2: radial +X, z=0.005, length=4.01m
CM   GW 3: radial -X, z=0.005, length=4.01m
CM   GW 4: radial +Y, z=0.005, length=4.01m
CM   GW 5: radial -Y, z=0.005, length=4.01m
CM
CM Ground: real average soil (GN 2), sigma=0.005 S/m, epsilon_r=13
CM Feed: voltage source EX 0 on segment 1 of GW1 (base of whip)
CM No LD card — resonant, retracted whip
CM
CM Note: 17m WARC band (100 kHz wide)
CM   Expected feedpoint Z ~ 35-50 ohms at resonance
CM   Segment count reduced proportionally to whip length
CE
GW 1 28  0.0 0.0 0.005  0.0 0.0 4.015  0.006
GW 2 14  0.0 0.0 0.005  4.01 0.0 0.005  0.006
GW 3 14  0.0 0.0 0.005 -4.01 0.0 0.005  0.006
GW 4 14  0.0 0.0 0.005  0.0 4.01 0.005  0.006
GW 5 14  0.0 0.0 0.005  0.0 -4.01 0.005  0.006
GE 1
GN 2 0 0 0  13 0.005
EX 0 1 1 0  1 0
FR 0 3 0 0  18.068 0.050
RP 0 37 73 1000  0 0 5 5
EN
